{#
  Public social posts for an event.

  Every attribute here is generated by src/_data/socialPosts.js from a platform
  enum plus a validated https address — no editor text is rendered as markup, and
  no stored value reaches a script tag.

  Instagram keeps the blockquote it has always used. Facebook and LinkedIn use
  their platforms' own iframe embeds, which need no SDK and no credentials.

  THE MARKUP IS THE LIVE SITE'S MARKUP. Each embed sits in a
  `.insta-embed reveal` block and any heading in a `.section-head reveal`, the
  same two blocks the live pages use — `.insta-embed` centres an embed and caps
  its width, which every platform's embed needs, and `reveal` is what js/main.js
  animates. A container of our own would have been a class css/style.css has
  never heard of, and css/style.css is a live deployed file we do not touch. No
  per-platform class either: nothing styles one, and an extra word in that
  attribute is enough to stop scripts/compare-standard-events.js recognising the
  block at all.

  EVERY post carries a plain link as well, outside the embed block so it is not
  laid out as a second item in that centred row. Embeds fail for ordinary
  reasons — a deleted or private post, a blocked tracker, a platform outage —
  and the page has to stay useful when they do.
#}
{%- if posts | length %}
{#- An event may carry its own heading for this region, migrated from the old
    "As seen on Instagram" block. Otherwise the standard label is used. -#}
{%- if event.social_heading and event.social_heading.heading and event.social_heading.heading[locale.code] %}
    <div class="section-head reveal">
{%- if event.social_heading.eyebrow and event.social_heading.eyebrow[locale.code] %}
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ event.social_heading.eyebrow[locale.code] }}</span>
{%- endif %}
      <h2 class="section-title">{{ event.social_heading.heading[locale.code] }}{% if event.social_heading.heading_fancy and event.social_heading.heading_fancy[locale.code] %} <span class="fancy">{{ event.social_heading.heading_fancy[locale.code] }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
    </div>
{%- endif %}
{%- for post in posts %}
    <div class="insta-embed reveal">
{%- if post.embed and post.embed.kind == "instagram" %}
      <blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-captioned data-instgrm-permalink="{{ post.url }}" data-instgrm-version="14"></blockquote>
{%- elif post.embed and post.embed.kind == "iframe" %}
      <iframe src="{{ post.embed.src }}" title="{{ t.socialPosts[post.platform] }}"
              loading="lazy" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"
              allowfullscreen sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups"></iframe>
{%- endif %}
    </div>
    <p class="event-social-link">
      <a href="{{ post.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ t.socialPosts[post.platform] }}</a>
    </p>
{%- endfor %}
{%- endif %}
